[00:02.59]You packed your bags and booked a plane
[00:02.59]你收拾好行李 订了张机票
[00:04.84]The taxi's taking you away
[00:04.84]坐上出租车 一路远去
[00:07.01]I know it's just a couple days
[00:07.01]我清楚分别不过才短暂几天
[00:09.32]A second without you is pain
[00:09.32]但没有你的一秒 都满是痛苦
[00:11.70]Maybe I'm just a fool who loves you
[00:11.70]也许我就是个太爱你的傻瓜
[00:20.74]When you're here, it's a sunny place
[00:20.74]有你在时 晴空万里
[00:22.81]But when you're gone, I can't explain
[00:22.81]但你一离去 我无从解释
[00:24.97]How everything seems to turn to grey
[00:24.97]万事万物 怎就转眼 灰暗失色
[00:27.40]Even food just loses taste
[00:27.40]哪怕是食物 也淡然无味
[00:29.76]Maybe I'm just a fool who loves you
[00:29.76]也许我就是个太爱你的傻瓜
[00:37.60]When we are saying goodbye
[00:37.60]我们道别时 
[00:40.27]You ask me, will I miss you?
[00:40.27]你问我：“我会想你吗？”
[00:43.06]Well, I just can't lie
[00:43.06]我真的说不了谎 
[00:45.55]I just can't lie
[00:45.55]说不了谎
[00:47.44]I'm dying alive every time that you leave
[00:47.44]每回你转身离开 我都生不如死
[00:51.53]'Cause a life without you's not one I want to live
[00:51.53]因为我不想要一个没有你的生活
[00:55.94]Kill me slowly
[00:55.94]慢慢折磨我 
[01:00.44]Kill me slowly
[01:00.44]缓缓扼杀我
[01:04.97]Though I'll see you again, that don't mean it don't sting
[01:04.97]尽管终有重逢 但也不代表 就不刺痛
[01:09.76]This is knife in the heart love that we've fallen in
[01:09.76]我们坠入了一场 心如刀绞的眷恋
[01:13.93]Kill me slowly
[01:13.93]慢慢折磨我 
[01:18.43]Kill me slowly
[01:18.43]缓缓扼杀我
[01:23.48]The scent of you on the pillowcase
[01:23.48]你的香味 余留在枕套
[01:25.87]The photo wall that has never changed
[01:25.87]照片墙 从未更换
[01:27.98]Sat on a bed in our little place
[01:27.98]独坐在我们屋中的床沿
[01:30.47]I'm still counting down the days
[01:30.47]我仍一天一天悉数岁月
[01:32.80]Maybe I'm just a fool who loves you
[01:32.80]也许我就是个太爱你的傻瓜
[01:41.64]Memories are all I got here until you call
[01:41.64]陪伴我的 只有回忆 直至你的来电响起
[01:45.87]But whenever I hear your voice like you're in this room
[01:45.87]无论何时 我听到你的声音 你徘徊的身影 恍如仍在昨日
